<title>UK: Bank Leu sets warrants on CS Holding.</title>
<headline>Bank Leu sets warrants on CS Holding.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Leu, Zurich said it has issued 7.50 million American-style call warrants on CS Holding shares.</p>
<p>Five warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    145 CHF		   ISSUE PRICE  2.59 CHF</p>
<p> PREMIUM	   13.6 PCT		  GEARING	10.8 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 09.DEC.96-14.OCT.98   PAYDATE	06.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  139 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
